# Lu par Cloudflare au déploiement, jamais servi ; frame-ancestors : Notion et son relais Iframely
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://notion.so https://*.notion.so https://notion.com https://*.notion.com https://notion.site https://*.notion.site https://iframe.ly https://*.iframe.ly https://iframely.net https://*.iframely.net
